WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.520
Hygelis detects a potential safety signal, but the evidence is not definitive.

2
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:09.880
Its confidence is moderate, and two important factors could explain the

3
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:10.880
pattern another way.

4
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.580
So the system does not declare causality.

5
00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:18.460
It does not decide that a medicine is unsafe, and it does not make a regulatory

6
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:18.960
decision.

7
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:23.020
Instead, Hygelis escalates the investigation for human review.

8
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:27.780
The reviewer can see the sources, related cases, reasoning, uncertainty,

9
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.120
and conflicting evidence behind the signal.

10
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.620
A qualified professional makes the decision.

11
00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.220
That decision becomes part of the audit trail.

12
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:39.120
The system learns from the outcome, while consequential decisions remain

13
00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.280
under human control.

14
00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.380
No evidence.

15
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.220
No autonomous conclusion.

16
00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.000
AI investigates.

17
00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:46.800
Qualified humans decide.
